    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "Overview",
      "content": {
        "json": "# Azure VM Disk SKU Limits (free metrics)\n\nThrottling diagnosis for **Azure VMs** uses built-in Azure Monitor platform metrics and Azure Resource Graph. The guest disk section uses the default no-charge OpenTelemetry metrics sent by Azure Monitor Agent to an Azure Monitor workspace. It does not require VM Insights or Log Analytics ingestion.\n\nStart at the **Throttling diagnosis** band to tell whether throttling comes from a single disk SKU limit or the VM SKU aggregate, then drill into the platform and guest disk sections. Azure Arc machines remain available in the full VM Disk Observability workbook."
      }
    },
