    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "GuestDiskHeading",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Guest disk performance and capacity (default OpenTelemetry metrics; no additional collection charge)\n\nThese views use `system.filesystem.usage`, `system.disk.operations`, `system.disk.io`, and `system.disk.operation_time` from the selected native Azure VM. Microsoft lists these metrics in the default OpenTelemetry metric set, which is collected at no additional cost. Azure Policy can install Azure Monitor Agent and associate the regional metrics DCR automatically.\n\nThis does not make the entire monitoring environment free. VM compute, Azure Managed Grafana, alerts, logs-based VM Insights and Log Analytics, and additional or per-process OpenTelemetry metrics can incur separate charges.\n\nThe capacity table reports decimal GB and used percentage, rounded to two decimal places. Performance charts use guest device names, exclude common pseudo devices, and remain separate from Azure data-disk LUNs.\n\nIf the section is empty, confirm the VM is running and select a time range after guest-metric onboarding. The capacity table requires a current sample; performance charts require samples inside the selected time range."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "name": "GuestFilesystemCapacity",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "{\"version\":\"PrometheusQueryProvider/1.0\",\"queryText\":\"label_replace(round((sum by (\\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\", device, mountpoint) ({\\\"system.filesystem.usage\\\", \\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\"=~\\\"(?i)^{VirtualMachines}$\\\", state=~\\\"used|free|reserved\\\", mountpoint!~\\\"^/(snap|sys|proc|dev|run)($|/)\\\"}) / 1000000000), 0.01), \\\"stat\\\", \\\"Size (GB)\\\", \\\"device\\\", \\\".*\\\") or label_replace(round((100 * sum by (\\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\", device, mountpoint) ({\\\"system.filesystem.usage\\\", \\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\"=~\\\"(?i)^{VirtualMachines}$\\\", state=\\\"used\\\", mountpoint!~\\\"^/(snap|sys|proc|dev|run)($|/)\\\"}) / clamp_min(sum by (\\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\", device, mountpoint) ({\\\"system.filesystem.usage\\\", \\\"microsoft.resourceid\\\"=~\\\"(?i)^{VirtualMachines}$\\\", state=~\\\"used|free|reserved\\\", mountpoint!~\\\"^/(snap|sys|proc|dev|run)($|/)\\\"}), 1)), 0.01), \\\"stat\\\", \\\"Used (%)\\\", \\\"device\\\", \\\".*\\\")\",\"type\":\"query\"}",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Guest filesystem capacity",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 16,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.monitor/accounts",
        "crossComponentResources": [
